0..77 Comment "// A parameter at a session type is spent by its body, as an end a fork binds"
78..153 Comment "// is. A call that moves an endpoint into such a parameter spends it at the"
154..164 Comment "// caller."
165..167 Comment "//"
168..239 Comment "// An endpoint left open at the body\'s end breaks the protocol its type"
240..313 Comment "// states. An action on an endpoint after a call took it acts on what the"
314..390 Comment "// caller no longer holds. A recursive definition descends on its parameter,"
391..425 Comment "// and an endpoint never descends."
426..428 Comment "//"
429..506 Comment "// The checker refuses the first at the placement as `LinearResidue`, and the"
507..585 Comment "// second at the action as `UsedAfterClose`. An endpoint handed to a parameter"
586..662 Comment "// that is not a session type stays an endpoint read as a value. A self-call"
663..735 Comment "// that hands its endpoint on is refused at the call as `StageNotBelow`."
736..738 Comment "//"
739..795 Comment "// - see: corpus/model/sessions/endpoint-parameter.gandr"
797..875 Comment "/// A parameter at a session type that nothing acts on: the body ends with the"
876..897 Comment "/// endpoint unspent."
